ame\":\"bash\",\"description\":\"Execute a bash command in the current working directory. Returns stdout and stderr. Output is truncated to last 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). If truncated, full output is saved to a temp file. Optionally provide a timeout in seconds.\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"description\":\"Shell command to execute\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"timeout\":{\"description\":\"Timeout in seconds (optional, no default timeout)\",\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"command\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"function\"},{\"name\":\"write\",\"description\":\"Write content to a file. Creates the file if it doesn't exist, overwrites if it does. Automatically creates parent directories.\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"content\":{\"description\":\"Content to write to the file\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"description\":\"Path to the file to write (relative or absolute)\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"content\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"function\"},{\"name\":\"mcp_hello-mcp_echo_921a5a7771\",\"description\":\"Echoes back the input\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"message\":{\"description\":\"Message to echo\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"message\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"function\"}]},\"output\":{\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"finish_reason\":\"aborted\",\"provider\":\"introspection\",\"model\":\"scripted-llm\",\"api\":\"openai-completions\"}]},\"system_instructions\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Use the declared hello MCP whenever the task asks you to echo a message.\\n## Managed workspace\\n\\n<workspace>\\n  <inputs path=\\\"/workspace/files\\\" access=\\\"read_write\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  <outputs path=\\\"/workspace/outputs\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  Save downloaded source material under files/ and deliverables under outputs/. Mounted uploads a